<Base
  title="Contact Red River Gorge Hiker"
  description="Contact Ryan D. Lewis about photography, displays, permissions, partnerships, or website corrections."
>
  <div class="page prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Email contact</p>
    <h1>Contact Red River Gorge Hiker</h1>
    <p class="lede">Contact Ryan D. Lewis about:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Photograph questions</li>
      <li>Local displays</li>
      <li>Editorial or promotional permissions</li>
      <li>Regional partnerships</li>
      <li>Website corrections</li>
      <li>Other appropriate Red River Gorge Hiker inquiries</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a></p>
    <p>Please include the photograph title and enough detail to understand the request.</p>

    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Fine Art America order questions:</strong> For a purchase, shipment, return, or order-service question involving an order placed through Fine Art America, use the order and support information supplied by Fine Art America.
    </div>

    <p>No phone number, personal mailing address, or additional contact information is published at launch.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
